{"code":"033200","name":"모아텍","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"전자장비와기기","sector_desc":"전자 부품·계측기·기판 등. 스마트폰·자동차·서버 등 전방 산업의 생산 사이클을 따릅니다.","desc":"동사는 1989년 설립되어 1997년 코스닥에 상장한 소형정밀모터 전문 기업으로, 134개의 계열회사와 3개의 관계회사를 보유하고 있음. 주요 사업으로 STEPPING MOTOR의 생산과 판매를 영위하고 있으며, 종속회사를 통해 부동산 임대업도 운영하고 있음. STEPPING MOTOR는 가전, 사무기기, 자동차, 통신 분야에 응용되며, 특히 자동차 부문이 매출액의 80% 이상을 차지하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":2345.0,"open":2310.0,"high":2425.0,"low":2220.0,"volume":3159,"amount":7407855.0,"ret_1d":0.2137,"gap":-1.2821,"range_pct":8.742,"ret_5":-3.8934,"ret_20":-5.2525,"ret_60":-11.3422,"ret_120":-42.8745,"ret_250":-27.957,"ma20":2454.5,"ma60":2506.6667,"ma120":2940.8333,"ma200":3248.725,"close_vs_ma200":-27.8178,"close_vs_ma60":-6.4495,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-23.492,"r2_60":0.5074,"slope_120":-69.91,"r2_120":0.8196,"slope_250":-29.0352,"r2_250":0.322,"high52":5300.0,"low52":2125.0,"pos_52w":6.9291,"dd_52w":-55.7547,"mdd_1y":-51.6529,"atr14_pct":4.4928,"vol_ann_60":24.1215,"vol_avg20":4905.4,"vol_ratio20":0.644,"vr5":0.3373,"vr20":0.1895,"amount_avg5":5894545.0,"amount_avg20":12138060.75,"amount_avg60":16222521.5833,"obv_chg20":10.7157,"turnover_20":1.0659,"pv_eff_20":-4.9279,"rsi14":33.0136,"frgn_net_5":-1060.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0115,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0115,"frgn_net_20":-4652.0,"inst_net_20":-1.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0505,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0506,"frgn_net_60":-4307.0,"inst_net_60":-1.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0468,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0468,"frgn_net_120":-14822.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.161,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.161,"foreign_ratio":79.8,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.05,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":-1.0,"op_margin_q":-0.6944,"op_qoq":66.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":75.0,"rev_yoy":37.1429,"op_trend_4q":45.7143,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-0.87,"debt_ratio":14.91,"per":null,"pbr":0.31,"div_yield":null,"fore